### AUTH ENDPOINTS
### Register a user
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "password"
}

### Seeded ADMIN login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

### Created USER login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "password"
}

### Tokens - run the login endpoint to get a token for ADMIN - run both the register and login endpoints to get a token for USER
