### GET ENDPOINTS
### GET all classes with PAGINATION
GET http://localhost:8080/classes?page=0&size=10&sort=name,asc

### GET class 1
GET http://localhost:8080/classes/1

### GET Spots-remaining on class 1
GET http://localhost:8080/classes/1/spots-remaining

### GET bookings class 1
GET http://localhost:8080/classes/1/bookings

### GET instructor = Jonas
GET http://localhost:8080/classes/search?instructor=Jonas

### POST ENDPOINTS
### Create a class with ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/classes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admintoken}}

{
  "name": "Cardio",
  "instructor": "Peter",
  "dayOfWeek": "Friday",
  "startTime": "17:30",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "maxParticipants": 15
}

### Create a class with USER
POST http://localhost:8080/classes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "name": "Cardio",
  "instructor": "Peter",
  "dayOfWeek": "Friday",
  "startTime": "17:30",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "maxParticipants": 15
}

### Book a class with admin
POST http://localhost:8080/classes/1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admintoken}}

{
  "participantName": "Sara Lind",
  "email": "sara.lind@example.com"
}

### PUT ENDPOINTS
### PUT classes ADMIN ONLY
PUT http://localhost:8080/classes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admintoken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Cardio",
  "instructor": "Peter",
  "dayOfWeek": "Friday",
  "startTime": "18:00",
  "durationMinutes": 60,
  "maxParticipants": 20
}

### PUT classes NO TOKEN
PUT http://localhost:8080/classes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Cardio",
  "instructor": "Peter",
  "dayOfWeek": "Friday",
  "startTime": "18:00",
  "durationMinutes": 60,
  "maxParticipants": 20
}

### DELETE ENDPOINTS
### DELETE classes ADMIN ONLY
DELETE http://localhost:8080/classes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admintoken}}

### DELETE bookings/6 ADMIN ONLY
DELETE http://localhost:8080/bookings/6
Authorization: Bearer {{admintoken}}

### DELETE classes NO TOKEN
DELETE http://localhost:8080/classes/2

### DELETE bookings/6 NO TOKEN
DELETE http://localhost:8080/bookings/5

